packet={'version':1,'run':r,'id':id,'assessment_by':'/root/boundary_metadata_a','round':'same FIRST1 first supplier-finding round; no reset of original caps','item_path':str(ip),'item_raw_sha256':sha(ip.read_bytes()),'proposal_path':str(fp),'proposal_raw_sha256':sha(fp.read_bytes()),'statement_definition_frontmatter_unchanged':before.split('## Proof')[0]==after.split('## Proof')[0],'confirmed_defects':[{'location':'1.3','defect':'Wrong extremal coefficient used to normalize resultant leading y term; adjacent swapped corner not covered by the stated corner-only premise.','counterexample':'Over Q, Q_jl(x,y)=2x+y and f=x give rho=y. The old c_x=2 normalization gives h=y^2/2 rather than a monic polynomial.'},{'location':'1.2','defect':'Recovery f(y)=f(x)+(y-x)partial(f) has the sign reversed for the defined partial=(f(y)-f(x))/(x-y). Vanishing conclusion is unchanged.'},{'location':'2.1','defect':'Prose cited later3.1 rather than unequal exchange1.3 and did not explicitly form a global next-position annihilator.'},{'location':'3.3','defect':'Length-d adjacent divided-difference chain was incorrectly identified with the full S_(d+1) alternating operator; one extended carrier length was off by one.'},{'location':'5.1','defect':'Selected m=L_b-b need not meet the proved beta_i+m>=L_b threshold.'}],'smallest_missing_prerequisites_resolved':'Actual y-extremal scalar c_y unit from Q3/Q4; determinant/adjugate elimination over k[y][x]/f; global finite product annihilator; complete-homogeneous recursion for length-d divided differences; correct eventual threshold. No new hypotheses or Statement narrowing.','contract_path':cp,'contract_raw_sha256':sha(pathlib.Path(cp).read_bytes()),'contract_field_operations':[{'json_pointer':'/contracts/'+id+'/'+k,'expected_value':c[k],'replacement_value':nc[k]} for k in ['derivations','citations'] if c[k]!=nc[k]],'manifest_operations':[],'manifest_reason':'Exact original Statement, source interfaces, dependencies and proof-strategy remain unchanged; derivation/citation-use proof mirrors only.','actual_direct_consumers':cons,'consumer_statement_changes':False,'source_context':{'pdf':'research/'+r+'-owner-cyclotomic-native11-consumer-escalations/trace-construction/kang-kashiwara.pdf','raw_sha256':sha(pathlib.Path('research/'+r+'-owner-cyclotomic-native11-consumer-escalations/trace-construction/kang-kashiwara.pdf').read_bytes()),'read':'Kang–Kashiwara1102.4677v4 Section4.1, Lemma4.2, Lemma4.3 complete proof, Corollary4.4, printed pp16-18. The global annihilator and length-d divided-difference tail method match the actual source argument. Determinant/adjugate monic elimination supplied explicitly locally.'},'original_history_preservation':'No mathematical acceptance or review/risk/native fields are replaced; exact guarded derivation and citation-use fields only.','eligibility':'Eligible for owner focused acceptance after exact proposal integration and same-reviewer afterbinding; no native gate or broadened whole-consumer audit claimed.','remaining_actual_holds':['Current canonical supplier retains these defects until proposal integration. MIX and narrow induction-surgery acceptance eligibility in actual-afterbinding.json are unaffected.']}
